{"title": "4 Marks, motion and rules", "html": "<div style=\"width:1440px;height:900px;background:#f2f2ef;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;padding:48px 56px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px\"><div><div style=\"font:500 11px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c8c90\">ADE illustration language</div><div style=\"font:650 28px/1.2 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a;margin-top:10px\">Marks, motion and rules</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:48px;flex:1\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:500 11px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c8c90\">Marks</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:200px;height:90px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"200\" height=\"90\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 90\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"41\" y=\"24\" width=\"120\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcdcd9\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" opacity=\".55\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"20\" width=\"120\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><path d=\"M44.8 65 L155.2 65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><rect x=\"45\" y=\"25\" width=\"110\" height=\"35\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" /><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"29\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" opacity=\"0.55\"/><circle cx=\"151\" cy=\"29\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" opacity=\"0.55\"/><rect x=\"54\" y=\"40\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" /><text x=\"61\" y=\"49.2\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\" letter-spacing=\".08em\" >SIMPLE PART</text></svg></div><div style=\"max-width:250px\"><div style=\"font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">Simple part</div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;margin-top:4px\">Needs no explaining. Thin mid-grey outline, no ring, no tag.</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:200px;height:90px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"200\" height=\"90\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 90\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"41\" y=\"30\" width=\"120\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcdcd9\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" opacity=\".55\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"26\" width=\"120\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><path d=\"M44.8 67 L155.2 67\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><rect x=\"45\" y=\"31\" width=\"110\" height=\"31\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" /><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"35\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" opacity=\"0.55\"/><circle cx=\"151\" cy=\"35\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" opacity=\"0.55\"/><rect x=\"129.2\" y=\"33\" width=\"22.8\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e6edfe\" stroke=\"#3e63dd\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" /><text x=\"140.6\" y=\"43\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#3e63dd\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\" letter-spacing=\".04em\">B2</text><rect x=\"48\" y=\"44\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" /><text x=\"55\" y=\"53.2\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\" letter-spacing=\".08em\" >CLICKABLE</text></svg></div><div style=\"max-width:250px\"><div style=\"font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">Clickable part</div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;margin-top:4px\">A blue reference tag inside its top-left or top-right corner (outside only when the part is too small); a blue outline appears on hover. The tag is its address: other explainers cite it as B2 or, across levels, L2 B2.</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:200px;height:90px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"200\" height=\"90\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 90\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"41\" y=\"30\" width=\"120\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcdcd9\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" opacity=\".55\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"26\" width=\"120\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" /><path d=\"M44.8 67 L155.2 67\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><rect x=\"45\" y=\"31\" width=\"110\" height=\"31\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" /><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"35\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" opacity=\"0.55\"/><circle cx=\"151\" cy=\"35\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" opacity=\"0.55\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"26\" width=\"120\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3e63dd\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" /><rect x=\"129.2\" y=\"33\" width=\"22.8\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#3e63dd\" stroke=\"#3e63dd\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" /><text x=\"140.6\" y=\"43\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\" letter-spacing=\".04em\">B2</text><rect x=\"48\" y=\"44\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" /><text x=\"55\" y=\"53.2\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#8a8a8f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\" letter-spacing=\".08em\" >OPEN NOW</text></svg></div><div style=\"max-width:250px\"><div style=\"font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">Open part</div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;margin-top:4px\">The part whose explainer is open: solid blue tag, heavier outline. Its explainer pops up on the part, with an arrow.</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:200px;height:90px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"200\" height=\"90\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 90\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"32\" width=\"80\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fbe3e3\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"1\" /><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"32\" r=\"7.5\" fill=\"#e5484d\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"35\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"0\" >1</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"49\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#18181a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\" letter-spacing=\".08em\" >MOVING</text></svg></div><div style=\"max-width:250px\"><div style=\"font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">Moving part</div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;margin-top:4px\">The only colour in the figure. Numbered 1 to 3; never more than 3 per figure.</div></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:500 11px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c8c90\">Motion in Fig 1 (L1)</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><div style=\"font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">1 \u00b7 Tape advances (A1)</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"36\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"62\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"88\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/></svg></div><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"36\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"62\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"88\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fbe3e3\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /></svg></div><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"-3\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"23\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"49\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"75\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fbe3e3\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"101\" y=\"25\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;max-width:390px\">Each step the tape shifts left one cell and the new token lands in the empty slot. 600 ms, eased.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><div style=\"font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">2 \u00b7 Odds rise (A4)</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"16\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"16\" width=\"8.556\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#e5484d\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"2.4839999999999995\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"1.2419999999999998\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /></svg></div><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"16\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"16\" width=\"34.224\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#e5484d\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"9.935999999999998\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"4.967999999999999\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /></svg></div><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"16\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"16\" width=\"57.04\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#e5484d\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"16.56\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"92\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"8.28\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /></svg></div></div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;max-width:390px\">Bars grow from zero to their probability after the model runs. The winning bar is the accent.</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><div style=\"font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">3 \u00b7 Token returns (pipe)</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><path d=\"M110 50 L110 22 L10 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M110 50 L110 22 L10 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"5.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M107.6 38.0 L110.0 35.0 L112.4 38.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M62.0 19.6 L59.0 22.0 L62.0 24.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><rect x=\"86\" y=\"13\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fbe3e3\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"1\" /></svg></div><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><path d=\"M110 50 L110 22 L10 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M110 50 L110 22 L10 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"5.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M107.6 38.0 L110.0 35.0 L112.4 38.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M62.0 19.6 L59.0 22.0 L62.0 24.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><rect x=\"50\" y=\"13\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fbe3e3\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"1\" /></svg></div><div style=\"width:120px;height:70px;background:#fbfbfa;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d4d4d6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"70\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 70\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><path d=\"M110 50 L110 22 L10 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M110 50 L110 22 L10 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"5.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M107.6 38.0 L110.0 35.0 L112.4 38.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M62.0 19.6 L59.0 22.0 L62.0 24.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><rect x=\"14\" y=\"13\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fbe3e3\" stroke=\"#e5484d\" stroke-width=\"1\" /></svg></div></div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;max-width:390px\">The picked token rides the pipe back to the tape, closing the loop. Then step 1 repeats.</div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:500 11px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c8c90\">Rules</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d4d4d6\"><span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;font:600 12px/1.5 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8c8c90\">01</span><span style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\">At most 3 levels: up to 2 prerequisites, then the main concept, which is the document title. Only the current level is shown; the main concept is always named.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d4d4d6\"><span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;font:600 12px/1.5 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8c8c90\">02</span><span style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\">Each level opens with one question. Yes moves on; No shows its illustration.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d4d4d6\"><span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;font:600 12px/1.5 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8c8c90\">03</span><span style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\">At most 3 moving parts per figure, and they are the only colour.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d4d4d6\"><span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;font:600 12px/1.5 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8c8c90\">04</span><span style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\">Every part that needs explaining is clickable and tagged; simple parts are not.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d4d4d6\"><span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;font:600 12px/1.5 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8c8c90\">05</span><span style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\">Names live on engraved plates on the part, never as floating labels or leader lines.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d4d4d6\"><span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;font:600 12px/1.5 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8c8c90\">06</span><span style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\">Every explainer lists its sources: links, PDFs, docs.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d4d4d6\"><span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;font:600 12px/1.5 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#8c8c90\">07</span><span style=\"font:400 14px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\">Motion is eased and loops slowly when idle; it stops on hover and with reduced motion.</span></div></div></div></div>"}